page('/trading/trade-ideas/','Trade idea planner','Write a scenario before looking for an entry. This page contains a planning worksheet, not live buy or sell calls.','<form id="plan-form" class="calculator"><div class="form-grid"><label>Market and timeframe<input name="market" value="XAU/USD · 1 hour" maxlength="100" required></label><label>Context<input name="context" placeholder="Trend, range, scheduled event…" maxlength="300" required></label><label>Entry condition<textarea name="entry" rows="3" required maxlength="2000"></textarea></label><label>Invalidation condition<textarea name="invalidation" rows="3" required maxlength="2000"></textarea></label><label>Risk and exit plan<textarea name="risk" rows="3" required maxlength="2000"></textarea></label><label>When to stand aside<textarea name="skip" rows="3" required maxlength="2000"></textarea></label></div><button class="button" type="submit">Download my plan</button></form><div class="notice"><h2>Follow the existing channel</h2><p>Raphael shares gold analysis and trade ideas on Telegram. Read the reasoning and risks; a posted setup is not a guarantee.</p><a href="https://t.me/+h-5A-mdBmhA5ZWQ1">Open the Black Gold Market channel →</a></div>')
page('/community/','Black Gold Market community','Follow the existing Telegram channel for gold market discussion and the reasoning behind posted setups.',cards([('https://t.me/+h-5A-mdBmhA5ZWQ1','TELEGRAM','Open the community channel','Use the existing channel. Posting permissions are controlled by its administrators.'),('/learn/','NEW HERE','Start with the learning path','Read the foundations before risking money.'),('/tools/trade-journal/','PRACTICE','Keep your own journal','Save a private, browser-local record of your practice trades.')])+'<div class="notice"><h2>Participate thoughtfully</h2><p>Discuss the reasoning, timeframe and invalidation behind an idea. Do not share account credentials, recovery phrases or private financial details. There is no separate on-site forum. Analysis membership availability is shown on the account page.</p></div>')
page('/faq/','Frequently asked questions','How the learning resources, market displays and community work.',''.join(f'<details class="faq-item"><summary>{q}</summary><p>{a}</p></details>' for q,a in [
 ('Are the courses and tools free?','The public academy, glossary, quizzes and calculators are free. The existing Trader’s Kit is optional and described separately on its own page.'),
 ('Will progress follow me to another device?','No. Lesson progress, quiz scores and practice-journal records are stored in this browser. Use the backup controls to export and restore supported records.'),
 ('Are market prices live?','TradingView supplies the embedded displays. Data timing varies by instrument and provider. The currency converter and strength comparison use dated daily reference rates, not executable quotes.'),
 ('Do you provide guaranteed trading results?','No. Educational resources, calculator outputs and community trade ideas cannot guarantee a profit or limit every possible loss.'),
 ('Why is a market widget blank?','A content blocker, network issue or the provider can prevent a display from loading. Use the adjacent link to open the source, or try again later. We do not substitute invented prices.'),
 ('Can I create a member account here?','Visit My account to check member-registration availability. Public learning resources and browser-local progress do not require an account.'),
 ('Where can I discuss a trade?','Use the existing Telegram channel and any discussion features its administrators enable. There is no separate web forum yet.'),
 ('How do I get the Blueprint or the Kit?','Use the Free Blueprint and The Kit links. Their existing signup and purchase pages remain available.')]))
page('/contact/','Contact Black Gold Market','Use the existing community channel to find its current contact options.','<div class="notice"><h2>Community and general enquiries</h2><p>Visit the official Telegram channel and use the contact information provided there. Do not send passwords, payment-card details, private keys or recovery phrases.</p><a class="button" href="https://t.me/+h-5A-mdBmhA5ZWQ1">Open official channel</a></div>')
page('/partners/','Partnership enquiries','For enquiries about educational collaborations or advertising, use the contact route below.','<div class="notice"><h2>Contact the team</h2><p>This page does not list approved brokers, paid endorsements or an affiliate programme. Any proposal needs to be reviewed by the Black Gold Market team.</p><a href="/contact/">Contact Black Gold Market →</a></div>')
page('/privacy/','Privacy and website data','A practical explanation of the data features used on this website.','<article class="lesson-body"><h2>Browser-local learning records</h2><p>Lesson completion, quiz scores and practice-journal records are stored in your browser. The website does not upload these records to a Black Gold Market account. Exported backup files are created on your device. Clearing website storage can erase local records.</p><h2>Analysis membership</h2><p>When member registration opens, account email, authentication data, membership expiry and payment-request records (including transaction IDs and review notes) are stored with Supabase. Transaction records are visible to their owner and authorized administrators. USDT transfers are public blockchain records. Session credentials are stored in this browser to keep you signed in; sign out on shared devices. For account-data requests, contact the team.</p><h2>Existing analytics and signup forms</h2><p>The site includes Google Analytics to measure visits and interactions. The Blueprint and Telegram signup forms send submitted information to the existing subscription service. Do not include sensitive financial or identity information in learning notes or contact enquiries.</p><h2>External data and links</h2><p>Market widgets connect to TradingView. Currency tools request reference data from Frankfurter. Those requests and any external links are subject to the providers’ own policies. Market displays may set or access information according to their services.</p><h2>Your controls</h2><p>You can manage website storage and cookies in your browser, choose whether to submit signup forms, and use the unsubscribe link in received emails. For questions about submitted information, use the <a href="/contact/">existing contact route</a>.</p></article>')
page('/risk-disclosure/','Risk disclosure','Understand the limits of educational content, market displays and calculator outputs.','<article class="lesson-body"><h2>Losses are possible</h2><p>Gold, foreign exchange, crypto assets and leveraged products can produce substantial losses. Leverage magnifies exposure; stop orders can execute beyond their trigger during gaps or poor liquidity. Product protections depend on the provider, contract and jurisdiction.</p><h2>Education and examples</h2><p>Lessons, quizzes, planning worksheets and community ideas are not personal financial advice. Hypothetical examples are not performance claims. A completed course or high quiz score does not demonstrate suitability for trading.</p><h2>Tools and third-party data</h2><p>Calculations depend on your inputs and their stated assumptions. They may exclude costs, margin requirements and execution risks. Market displays and daily reference rates can be delayed, unavailable or revised. Verify contract terms and executable prices independently before making decisions.</p><h2>Further reading</h2><p><a href="https://www.cftc.gov/LearnAndProtect/AdvisoriesAndArticles/ForeignCurrencyTrading/index.htm">CFTC: foreign currency trading</a> · <a href="https://www.investor.gov/crypto-assets">Investor.gov: crypto assets</a>.</p></article>')
